--- a/doc/stunnel.8.in
+++ b/doc/stunnel.8.in
@@ -201,7 +201,7 @@
 .PP
 The default logging level is notice (5).
 .PP
-The syslog `daemon' facility will be used unless a facility name is
+The syslog `authpriv' facility will be used unless a facility name is
